01:18:07.362 --> 01:18:10.362
You can try to go around in another way, it will not work.

525
01:18:10.362 --> 01:18:14.362
Jesus said, I am the way, I am the door.

526
01:18:14.362 --> 01:18:17.362
You must go through the cross, you must get poisoning for meaning.

527
01:18:17.362 --> 01:18:20.362
You have nothing else to bring.

528
01:18:33.362 --> 01:18:35.362
Flesh will not inherit the kingdom.

529
01:18:38.362 --> 01:18:40.362
You must be born again.

530
01:18:42.362 --> 01:18:43.362
That is not a suggestion.

531
01:18:53.362 --> 01:18:57.362
Christ says, you must be born again by my Father, by the Spirit.

532
01:18:58.362 --> 01:18:59.362
It is not an option.

533
01:19:02.362 --> 01:19:04.362
It is not just a suggestion that Christ gives.

534
01:19:05.362 --> 01:19:07.362
It is the way in.

535
01:19:10.362 --> 01:19:12.362
But once you are inside, what do you do then?

536
01:19:13.362 --> 01:19:14.362
How do you live then?

537
01:19:17.362 --> 01:19:19.362
Hopefully with the Spirit increasing in you.

538
01:19:24.362 --> 01:19:27.362
For that is the promise of your resurrection and your glorified body.

539
01:19:29.362 --> 01:19:31.362
Flesh will not inherit the kingdom.

540
01:19:32.362 --> 01:19:33.362
Only the Spirit.

541
01:19:34.362 --> 01:19:35.362
Do you understand that?

542
01:19:36.362 --> 01:19:38.362
So you must be born again.

543
01:19:41.362 --> 01:19:44.362
And then you must live by the Spirit and no longer according to the flesh.

544
01:19:49.362 --> 01:19:54.362
If you come to that point and all you have is flesh and sin, then you will not enter in.

545
01:19:55.362 --> 01:19:56.362
Then that cannot happen.

546
01:19:59.362 --> 01:20:00.362
We do not want that to happen.

547
01:20:01.362 --> 01:20:03.362
In that kingdom age, we do not want sin anymore, do we?

548
01:20:06.362 --> 01:20:07.362
This is the good news.

549
01:20:10.362 --> 01:20:12.362
In the kingdom age, there is no sin.

550
01:20:13.362 --> 01:20:14.362
No death.

551
01:20:22.362 --> 01:20:25.362
No tears, no mourning over people who die from sickness.

552
01:20:25.362 --> 01:20:27.362
The Lord says, I make all things new.

553
01:20:31.362 --> 01:20:37.362
But that means we are now in a very important place.

554
01:20:38.362 --> 01:20:39.362
And it matters.

555
01:20:40.362 --> 01:20:42.362
It really matters how we live.

556
01:20:44.362 --> 01:20:46.362
So I want to go to 1 Corinthians 15.

557
01:20:49.362 --> 01:20:52.362
And that is a big chunk of the Bible.

558
01:20:52.362 --> 01:20:53.362
And this is the good news.

559
01:20:53.362 --> 01:20:54.362
This is the gospel.

560
01:20:54.362 --> 01:20:57.362
And not only the gospel of salvation, but the gospel of the kingdom.

561
01:21:06.362 --> 01:21:07.362
And Paul writes to the Corinthians.

562
01:21:07.362 --> 01:21:10.362
And if you know that church of the Corinthians, it was quite a mess.

563
01:21:11.362 --> 01:21:12.362
And Paul writes to the Corinthians.

564
01:21:13.362 --> 01:21:15.362
And if you know that church of the Corinthians, it was quite a mess.

565
01:21:23.362 --> 01:21:27.362
And wherever you look, you will not find a perfect church.

566
01:21:27.362 --> 01:21:29.362
For we are all a bit of a mess.

567
01:21:46.362 --> 01:21:47.362
Do you know that joke?

568
01:21:47.362 --> 01:21:49.362
Don't go to the perfect church.

569
01:21:49.362 --> 01:21:52.362
For as soon as you step inside, it is ruined.

570
01:22:08.362 --> 01:22:14.362
As a shepherd, Paul addresses many issues that were present in the church.

571
01:22:20.362 --> 01:22:25.362
And then he comes to chapter 15 and discusses a theological issue that is at play.

572
01:22:34.362 --> 01:22:43.362
For what has come into that church of the Corinthians is that a claim was made that the resurrection of the dead would not be possible.

573
01:22:46.362 --> 01:22:48.362
And Paul says, this is a problem.

574
01:22:49.362 --> 01:22:54.362
So Paul gives a line-by-line explanation of the gospel that he has preached.

575
01:23:00.362 --> 01:23:03.362
And which they have already believed in faith.

576
01:23:07.362 --> 01:23:10.362
And that also means the resurrection. So I will start with verse 1.

577
01:23:10.362 --> 01:23:13.362
And the resurrection is part of it. So I want to start in verse 1.

578
01:23:20.362 --> 01:23:24.362
So brothers and sisters, I remind you of the gospel that I preached to you.

579
01:23:26.362 --> 01:23:28.362
Many gospels are going around.

580
01:23:30.362 --> 01:23:31.362
But this is the gospel.

581
01:23:34.362 --> 01:23:36.362
And then he says that you have also accepted.

582
01:23:37.362 --> 01:23:39.362
And what your foundation is.

583
01:23:47.362 --> 01:23:49.362
And through this faith you are saved.

584
01:23:55.362 --> 01:23:58.362
If you hold firmly to the word that I have proclaimed to you.

585
01:24:02.362 --> 01:24:05.362
And that little word 'if' is important in this sentence.

586
01:24:07.362 --> 01:24:08.362
Hold on to it.

587
01:24:10.362 --> 01:24:11.362
You must stay with it.

588
01:24:13.362 --> 01:24:15.362
You do not give up halfway.

589
01:24:20.362 --> 01:24:23.362
If you hold on to everything that I have preached to you.

590
01:24:25.362 --> 01:24:27.362
And this is a word for us today as well.

591
01:24:31.362 --> 01:24:34.362
Otherwise, you have come to faith in vain.

592
01:24:36.362 --> 01:24:41.362
In other words, without it bringing you anything and without you receiving a reward.

593
01:24:45.362 --> 01:24:47.362
For what I have received, I pass on to you.

594
01:24:53.362 --> 01:24:55.362
The most important thing that I have passed on to you.

595
01:24:56.362 --> 01:24:57.362
Sorry.

596
01:24:58.362 --> 01:25:01.362
That Christ died for our sin, as it is written in the Scriptures.

597
01:25:02.362 --> 01:25:04.362
That he was buried.

598
01:25:10.362 --> 01:25:12.362
And that he was raised on the third day.

599
01:25:12.362 --> 01:25:14.362
And do you remember, that is what it was about.

600
01:25:17.362 --> 01:25:20.362
That he was raised on the third day, as it is written in the Scriptures.

601
01:25:24.362 --> 01:25:28.362
And Christ has done everything in the fulfillment of the books.

602
01:25:31.362 --> 01:25:34.362
And that he appeared to Peter and Cephas.

603
01:25:35.362 --> 01:25:37.362
And then to the twelve disciples.

604
01:25:41.362 --> 01:25:45.362
And afterwards he appeared to more than five hundred brothers and sisters at once.

605
01:25:46.362 --> 01:25:47.362
Do you believe this?

606
01:25:49.362 --> 01:25:51.362
This is the gospel.

607
01:25:54.362 --> 01:25:57.362
You must believe that he came as a man.

608
01:26:02.362 --> 01:26:05.362
That he died, that he was dead for three days.

609
01:26:08.362 --> 01:26:11.362
And in the Jewish tradition, that really means very dead.

610
01:26:12.362 --> 01:26:14.362
And that he has risen.

611
01:26:25.362 --> 01:26:28.362
He was really dead and he rose after three days.

612
01:26:28.362 --> 01:26:30.362
And he appeared to more than five hundred people.

613
01:26:30.362 --> 01:26:32.362
And this is a part of your faith.

614
01:26:39.362 --> 01:26:45.362
And afterwards he appeared to James and Paul.

615
01:26:45.362 --> 01:26:46.362
We are going to Paul.

616
01:26:46.362 --> 01:26:48.362
Ultimately, he appeared to Paul.

617
01:26:48.362 --> 01:26:50.362
Do you remember Paul?

618
01:26:51.362 --> 01:26:55.362
He meets Jesus, the risen Jesus, on the road to Damascus.

619
01:26:55.362 --> 01:26:56.362
A few years later.

620
01:27:02.362 --> 01:27:07.362
So when he is born abnormally, he says that he was not among the first twelve.

621
01:27:07.362 --> 01:27:12.362
I was later called by the Lord when I actually appeared in the church.

622
01:27:18.362 --> 01:27:22.362
But Jesus appeared to him while he was busy persecuting Christians.

623
01:27:24.362 --> 01:27:27.362
But he has seen the risen Christ.

624
01:27:27.362 --> 01:27:29.362
And that is important.

625
01:27:40.362 --> 01:27:43.362
And I believe that still applies today.

626
01:27:43.362 --> 01:27:48.362
That real apostles, real people who build churches, have met the risen Christ.

627
01:27:48.362 --> 01:27:53.362
Maybe not seen with their own eyes, but they know who he is and that no one can take that away.

628
01:27:58.362 --> 01:28:01.362
And if you know the story of Pastor Agnes, she truly met the Lord.

629
01:28:01.362 --> 01:28:05.362
And that means you can no longer deny him. You must follow him.

630
01:28:05.362 --> 01:28:11.362
It is such a deeply rooted conviction. He is the Lord. I must follow him.

631
01:28:19.362 --> 01:28:25.362
Day by day, apostles, prophets, teachers, they must know the Lord themselves.

632
01:28:32.362 --> 01:28:37.362
It is not a dream to be cool in the church. That is not it.

633
01:28:42.362 --> 01:28:46.362
It is more than that. It contains more than that.

634
01:28:47.362 --> 01:28:51.362
So Paul is rebuilding the gospel that he preaches.

635
01:28:56.362 --> 01:28:59.362
And he reminds them of the work of Christ.

636
01:29:02.362 --> 01:29:07.362
And that we must believe all parts of it.

637
01:29:11.362 --> 01:29:14.362
If we want to endure until our resurrection.

638
01:29:16.362 --> 01:29:18.362
And starting from verse 12 he says...

639
01:29:25.362 --> 01:29:29.362
But when it is proclaimed that Christ has been raised from the dead...

640
01:29:32.362 --> 01:29:36.362
How can some of you say that the dead will not rise?

641
01:29:41.362 --> 01:29:46.362
And Paul applies the logic here. If the dead do not rise, then Christ has not been raised either.

642
01:29:51.362 --> 01:29:56.362
And if Christ has not been raised, then our proclamation is without content and your faith is pointless.

643
01:30:02.362 --> 01:30:08.362
In other words, says the Lord to Corinth, if you continue on this path, you are destroying your own resurrection.

644
01:30:09.362 --> 01:30:11.362
Then you are destroying your own faith.

645
01:30:14.362 --> 01:30:16.362
And even more than that.

646
01:30:21.362 --> 01:30:25.362
And then we would be false witnesses of our group as apostles.

647
01:30:26.362 --> 01:30:30.362
And then we would be false witnesses of our God as apostles.

648
01:30:41.362 --> 01:30:47.362
And then we would have wrongly told that Christ has risen, but we have met Him. We know it.

649
01:30:56.362 --> 01:31:00.362
For if the dead are not raised, then Christ has not been raised either.

650
01:31:06.362 --> 01:31:11.362
And if Christ has not been raised, then your faith is useless and you are still a prisoner of your sin.

651
01:31:13.362 --> 01:31:14.362
And that is a problem.

652
01:31:16.362 --> 01:31:17.362
This is a problem.

653
01:31:19.362 --> 01:31:21.362
Do you see what Paul is defending here?

654
01:31:26.362 --> 01:31:34.362
If you continue on this path of claiming that Christ has not been raised, then you will not rise either, and that is a problem.

655
01:31:42.362 --> 01:31:47.362
In other words, there is no hope for you if Christ has not been raised from the dead.

656
01:31:52.362 --> 01:31:54.362
So do not tear down your faith.

657
01:31:56.362 --> 01:31:58.362
For it will destroy you.

658
01:32:06.362 --> 01:32:13.362
And Paul explains here, listen, if we do not believe this, then everything we are doing here is a waste of time.

659
01:32:14.362 --> 01:32:19.362
But Paul says, you know, it is so true, I have met Him, we have seen Him.

660
01:32:20.362 --> 01:32:26.362
Hold on to that hope with everything you are, and then you will rise with Him.

661
01:32:27.362 --> 01:32:32.362
Your resurrection completely depends on the fact that Christ has risen.

662
01:32:42.362 --> 01:32:43.362
And that is a problem.

663
01:32:45.362 --> 01:32:46.362
And that is a problem.

664
01:32:50.362 --> 01:32:51.362
And that is a problem.

665
01:32:52.362 --> 01:32:57.362
For flesh cannot rise, he will make you rise by the power of the spirit.

666
01:33:01.362 --> 01:33:05.362
And then he continues in verse 21 and this is the gospel of the kingdom.

667
01:33:10.362 --> 01:33:12.362
As death came through a man,

668
01:33:12.362 --> 01:33:14.362
As death came through a man,

669
01:33:21.362 --> 01:33:24.362
So also the resurrection from the dead came through a man.

670
01:33:28.362 --> 01:33:30.362
As we all die through Adam,

671
01:33:33.362 --> 01:33:36.362
So we will all be made alive through Christ.

672
01:33:43.362 --> 01:33:48.362
And then he says but then he will explain what is to come, the gospel of the kingdom.

673
01:33:50.362 --> 01:33:52.362
But each in his own order.

674
01:33:54.362 --> 01:33:55.362
Christ as the first.

675
01:33:58.362 --> 01:34:00.362
He is the firstborn from the dead.

676
01:34:02.362 --> 01:34:04.362
And afterward, when he comes.

677
01:34:05.362 --> 01:34:06.362
He comes.

678
01:34:09.362 --> 01:34:11.362
This is what you say you believe.

679
01:34:12.362 --> 01:34:15.362
That Christ has not come once, but that he will come a second time.

680
01:34:20.362 --> 01:34:22.362
This is what we say we believe.

681
01:34:33.362 --> 01:34:39.362
If you believe that Christ came the first time, died, and rose again, then you must also believe that he will come again.

682
01:34:43.362 --> 01:34:47.362
So when he comes, a time, a moment, those who belong to him.

683
01:34:56.362 --> 01:34:59.362
He speaks of the resurrection, he is first, he is first in everything.

684
01:35:05.362 --> 01:35:09.362
And when he returns, you will see what happens then, you will all rise up.

685
01:35:13.362 --> 01:35:14.362
It is a progression.

686
01:35:16.362 --> 01:35:18.362
And it continues and then the end comes.

687
01:35:20.362 --> 01:35:21.362
The end of what?

688
01:35:23.362 --> 01:35:24.362
The end of this age.

689
01:35:26.362 --> 01:35:27.362
This age will end.

690
01:35:29.362 --> 01:35:30.362
When Christ comes, it is over.

691
01:35:33.362 --> 01:35:34.362
Time changes.

692
01:35:37.362 --> 01:35:39.362
Christ will not be hidden forever.

693
01:35:43.362 --> 01:35:46.362
When Christ comes, he will openly reveal himself to the whole planet.

694
01:35:52.362 --> 01:35:53.362
Christ is not hidden forever.

695
01:35:58.362 --> 01:36:01.362
He is here now, he is hidden now, so that we enter the kingdom through faith.

696
01:36:06.362 --> 01:36:07.362
But he will not remain hidden forever.

697
01:36:09.362 --> 01:36:10.362
This is the hope in Christ.

698
01:36:12.362 --> 01:36:13.362
I want him to come.

699
01:36:18.362 --> 01:36:22.362
Those who wait for him to appear, you want him to come.

700
01:36:26.362 --> 01:36:28.362
You long to see him, says Peter.

701
01:36:34.362 --> 01:36:40.362
You live in faith and the expectation that a day will come when the clouds will part and the Holy One will come.

702
01:36:43.362 --> 01:36:44.362
I believe this.

703
01:36:53.362 --> 01:36:55.362
And that affects my life day by day.

704
01:36:56.362 --> 01:36:57.362
It influences my Monday and my Tuesday.

705
01:36:58.362 --> 01:36:59.362
And that is exactly the intention.

706
01:37:01.362 --> 01:37:02.362
Some of you do not change.

707
01:37:08.362 --> 01:37:11.362
You all believe it, but not on Monday or Friday, because then I do my own thing.

708
01:37:13.362 --> 01:37:15.362
But some are all in.

709
01:37:20.362 --> 01:37:22.362
And this is the majority of the church.

710
01:37:29.362 --> 01:37:33.362
It is truly the intention that your life looks different when you are a Christian.

711
01:37:43.362 --> 01:37:49.362
It is not, I love Christ and he has forgiven all my sins, so I will just continue in my sins.

712
01:37:49.362 --> 01:37:53.362
If you do that, then you stand naked before him on the day he comes.

713
01:37:55.362 --> 01:37:56.362
We no longer live in that place.

714
01:37:58.362 --> 01:37:59.362
The time has changed.

715
01:37:59.362 --> 01:38:13.362
You must believe and then in your life work that shows you are a son and a daughter who lives by the Spirit.

716
01:38:20.362 --> 01:38:22.362
It is the intention that it has an impact on your life.

717
01:38:30.362 --> 01:38:39.362
This is what it is all about. The good news is not that Jesus loves me while I just do whatever I feel like.

718
01:38:39.362 --> 01:38:43.362
No, He gave his life to set you free.

719
01:38:52.362 --> 01:38:57.362
So if you live in a lifestyle of sin and you continue in it, then it is only flesh.

720
01:39:00.362 --> 01:39:04.362
And flesh cannot inherit.

721
01:39:07.362 --> 01:39:09.362
And I am not angry with you.

722
01:39:09.362 --> 01:39:16.362
Some of you are playing a dangerous game with coming and singing songs of love to Christ.

723
01:39:16.362 --> 01:39:19.362
And your life is not this way.

724
01:39:19.362 --> 01:39:25.362
The resurrection is the unveiling of what you truly are in Christ.

725
01:39:25.362 --> 01:39:27.362
I hope we understand this.

726
01:39:40.362 --> 01:39:44.362
The song is not enough.

727
01:39:46.362 --> 01:39:48.362
And I love the song.

728
01:39:50.362 --> 01:39:58.362
But if my life is not in accordance with the Word and the Spirit of God working through that Word,

729
01:39:59.362 --> 01:40:03.362
then you will see that when He comes,

730
01:40:05.362 --> 01:40:09.362
when He is fully revealed, that also applies to you.

731
01:40:11.362 --> 01:40:13.362
He is like the light.

732
01:40:17.362 --> 01:40:19.362
He is still yet to be revealed.

733
01:40:20.362 --> 01:40:22.362
He is like the light.

734
01:40:26.362 --> 01:40:31.362
He is still yet to be unveiled at this moment and that is good for us. Do you understand that?

735
01:40:33.362 --> 01:40:36.362
If He were to come now in His full glory,

736
01:40:38.362 --> 01:40:41.362
many of us would fall dead on the spot.

737
01:40:42.362 --> 01:40:44.362
For we do not live in the Spirit.

738
01:40:45.362 --> 01:40:47.362
We live in the flesh.

739
01:40:49.362 --> 01:40:52.362
And everything will be revealed.

740
01:40:55.362 --> 01:40:58.362
And this is the true gospel.

741
01:41:00.362 --> 01:41:03.362
We are not playing a game week in, week out.

742
01:41:04.362 --> 01:41:06.362
It is your life.

743
01:41:07.362 --> 01:41:09.362
And it is a matter of life or death.

744
01:41:10.362 --> 01:41:12.362
Do not waste another week.

745
01:41:14.362 --> 01:41:16.362
Do not play with sin.

746
01:41:16.362 --> 01:41:18.362
Sin is death.

747
01:41:26.362 --> 01:41:28.362
Sin...

748
01:41:30.362 --> 01:41:32.362
Sin piles up wrath.

749
01:41:39.362 --> 01:41:44.362
Without the work of Christ in your life, without the Spirit that transforms you,

750
01:41:46.362 --> 01:41:49.362
you will not stand in that resurrection.

751
01:41:57.362 --> 01:42:03.362
Only the Word and the work of the Spirit in your life will be revealed.

752
01:42:07.362 --> 01:42:09.362
The King is coming.

753
01:42:10.362 --> 01:42:12.362
And the kingdom is coming.

754
01:42:13.362 --> 01:42:17.362
And you will be like Christ when He appears.

755
01:42:21.362 --> 01:42:25.362
You will be raised in that which cannot perish.

756
01:42:27.362 --> 01:42:30.362
You will receive a glorious body.

757
01:42:35.362 --> 01:42:40.362
And you will need that body to be able to live in that fully revealed,

758
01:42:41.362 --> 01:42:44.362
that full glory of Christ.

759
01:42:47.362 --> 01:42:50.362
No flesh can inherit the kingdom.

760
01:42:55.362 --> 01:42:59.362
Only those who have been transformed by the Spirit,

761
01:43:00.362 --> 01:43:02.362
they will be there.

762
01:43:03.362 --> 01:43:05.362
And Paul continues.

763
01:43:11.362 --> 01:43:16.362
And then Paul goes on about the subject of how they will be raised up.

764
01:43:22.362 --> 01:43:25.362
And what kind of body will it be then?

765
01:43:30.362 --> 01:43:35.362
And I am not going to read it all now, but read at home from verse 35 to 44.

766
01:43:41.362 --> 01:43:47.362
And what Paul is describing here is the difference in resurrection bodies.

767
01:43:59.362 --> 01:44:05.362
In the natural creation, God has already given more glory to some things than to others.

768
01:44:06.362 --> 01:44:09.362
The sun has more glory than the moon.

769
01:44:12.362 --> 01:44:15.362
