Even what Vanessa preached.

1024
02:09:35.362 --> 02:09:36.362
Means to say.

1025
02:09:37.362 --> 02:09:40.362
You go through the sanctification process with Jesus.

1026
02:09:41.362 --> 02:09:44.362
You yourself cannot handle the sanctification process.

1027
02:09:45.362 --> 02:09:47.362
So you cannot fix yourself first.

1028
02:09:48.362 --> 02:09:49.362
Before you have Christ on.

1029
02:09:50.362 --> 02:09:51.362
That is the wrong order.

1030
02:09:52.362 --> 02:09:53.362
Clearly explained today.

1031
02:09:54.362 --> 02:09:55.362
Entry is with Jesus.

1032
02:09:55.362 --> 02:09:58.362
And with Jesus you engage in sanctification.

1033
02:09:59.362 --> 02:10:00.362
Through His Word and through the Spirit.

1034
02:10:01.362 --> 02:10:03.362
Accept Jesus today.

1035
02:10:04.362 --> 02:10:07.362
Repent of your sin and be baptized, says Peter.

1036
02:10:08.362 --> 02:10:09.362
Repent of your sin.

1037
02:10:10.362 --> 02:10:11.362
Repent to Jesus and be baptized.

1038
02:10:12.362 --> 02:10:13.362
Hallelujah.

1039
02:10:14.362 --> 02:10:17.362
Elmar, may I see the prayer on the screen please.

1040
02:10:19.362 --> 02:10:20.362
Shall we pray this together?

1041
02:10:21.362 --> 02:10:22.362
Shall we pray it out loud?

1042
02:10:22.362 --> 02:10:25.362
When we pray this out loud, it means that you are praying it yourself.

1043
02:10:26.362 --> 02:10:29.362
And because we pray it out loud, we do it collectively.

1044
02:10:30.362 --> 02:10:34.362
That means we believe this together and also pray it together as a statement.

1045
02:10:35.362 --> 02:10:37.362
And for those people who have never prayed this before.

1046
02:10:38.362 --> 02:10:40.362
Or who have never prayed this with their heart.

1047
02:10:41.362 --> 02:10:44.362
When we do it together out loud, we all join in.

1048
02:10:45.362 --> 02:10:46.362
For it is valid for everyone.

1049
02:10:47.362 --> 02:10:49.362
And it is urgent for those who have never done it before.

1050
02:10:50.362 --> 02:10:51.362
Shall we pray this together?

1051
02:10:52.362 --> 02:10:53.362
Thank You, Jesus.

1052
02:10:54.362 --> 02:10:57.362
I believe that You are the Son of God.

1053
02:10:58.362 --> 02:11:01.362
I believe that You died on the cross for my sin.

1054
02:11:02.362 --> 02:11:04.362
Forgive me of all my mistakes.

1055
02:11:05.362 --> 02:11:07.362
I invite You into my life, Jesus.

1056
02:11:08.362 --> 02:11:10.362
Give me a new start.

1057
02:11:11.362 --> 02:11:13.362
Help me to live for You.

1058
02:11:14.362 --> 02:11:16.362
From today on, I am a child of God.

1059
02:11:17.362 --> 02:11:18.362
Amen. Amen.

1060
02:11:19.362 --> 02:11:20.362
Hallelujah.

1061
02:11:21.362 --> 02:11:24.362
Elmar, please leave that prayer up for a moment.

1062
02:11:25.362 --> 02:11:26.362
Sorry to ask it one more time.

1063
02:11:27.362 --> 02:11:28.362
I want to take another look at that last part.

1064
02:11:29.362 --> 02:11:30.362
Help me to live for You.

1065
02:11:31.362 --> 02:11:35.362
That sentence, that is going through sanctification together with Jesus.

1066
02:11:36.362 --> 02:11:38.362
That is the sanctification that Vanessa's sermon was about.

1067
02:11:39.362 --> 02:11:41.362
Help me to live for You.

1068
02:11:42.362 --> 02:11:46.362
Shall we place our hand on our heart at the end of this service?

1069
02:11:47.362 --> 02:11:48.362
Place a hand on our heart.

1070
02:11:50.362 --> 02:11:53.362
Jesus, oh Jesus, I want to ask You.

1071
02:11:54.362 --> 02:11:57.362
Help us to live for You.

1072
02:11:58.362 --> 02:12:02.362
Help us to go through that sanctification.

1073
02:12:03.362 --> 02:12:05.362
Help us Holy Spirit.

1074
02:12:10.362 --> 02:12:16.362
Help us to distance ourselves from the things that contribute to the flesh.

1075
02:12:17.362 --> 02:12:23.362
And help us to do the things that contribute to the will of the Spirit.

1076
02:12:24.362 --> 02:12:26.362
Help us Holy Spirit.

1077
02:12:27.362 --> 02:12:33.362
We acknowledge that our flesh is in conflict sometimes, or often, or daily with the Spirit.

1078
02:12:34.362 --> 02:12:41.362
Help us Holy Spirit to be more than conquerors in the Spirit every time.

1079
02:12:42.362 --> 02:12:44.362
Help us to be clean.

1080
02:12:44.362 --> 02:12:50.362
Help us to be continuously, day in and day out, engaged with You.

1081
02:12:51.362 --> 02:12:54.362
Help us Holy Spirit to tackle difficult things.

1082
02:12:55.362 --> 02:12:58.362
Things that we find difficult in our flesh that we hold on to.

1083
02:12:59.362 --> 02:13:02.362
Help us Holy Spirit to be more than conquerors over them.

1084
02:13:03.362 --> 02:13:05.362
Help us Lord to break free.

1085
02:13:06.362 --> 02:13:15.362
When we know rationally and when we know by the Spirit that there are still things at play in our flesh that we hold on to.

1086
02:13:16.362 --> 02:13:21.362
Moreover, we have a wisdom problem of yes but how do I get out of this.

1087
02:13:22.362 --> 02:13:29.362
For example, in relationships, for example in certain sins in which you are stuck and you just don't know what the way out is.

1088
02:13:29.362 --> 02:13:36.362
You just don't know yes I have put myself in this situation and I just don't know if I can get out of it.

1089
02:13:37.362 --> 02:13:39.362
Maybe I am not brave enough to get out of this.

1090
02:13:40.362 --> 02:13:42.362
Maybe I need to stop something. Maybe I need to end a relationship.

1091
02:13:43.362 --> 02:13:45.362
Maybe I need to do something that is very bold.

1092
02:13:46.362 --> 02:13:54.362
Maybe this is difficult for you and you are in your flesh, you are too weak to break free from things and you know it.

1093
02:13:54.362 --> 02:14:02.362
Holy Spirit help us to live for you. Make us conquerors through the Spirit.

1094
02:14:03.362 --> 02:14:14.362
I bless us as a church while we have our hands on our hearts. I bless us as a church that we will be stronger through the Spirit.

1095
02:14:15.362 --> 02:14:21.362
That we will have victory over everything that does not belong to the life of a holy Christian.

1096
02:14:21.362 --> 02:14:30.362
That we will have victory and I can guarantee you church, I can guarantee you that there is peace there.

1097
02:14:31.362 --> 02:14:35.362
From what Vanessa just read in Romans, there will be peace.

1098
02:14:36.362 --> 02:14:44.362
When you have made that entrance, when you together with the Holy Spirit have gained victory over the things that no longer belong to your new creation.

1099
02:14:45.362 --> 02:14:54.362
Wow, what a glory. Wonderful. And I bless us with that in the mighty name of Jesus. Amen and amen. Hallelujah.

1100
02:14:55.362 --> 02:14:57.362
Praise God. Praise God.

1101
02:15:00.362 --> 02:15:05.362
The service is over. Go enjoy a sausage roll. That also belongs to the kingdom of God.

1102
02:15:06.362 --> 02:15:11.362
For those people who want to race home quickly because a race is starting. Go for it Formula 1.

1103
02:15:11.362 --> 02:15:17.362
And tomorrow is the prayer or not. See you tomorrow in church. Prayer. Bye bye.
